text = "Citric Hero spits acid to zombies that are close.

Cost: 225
Recharge: 15
Toughness: 300
Special: Charges his acid when zombies are not close.

Citric Hero is loved by all plants of all ages. In a recent interview he said \"when fighting, I'm 
always thinking of all my fans who cheer for me!\" His fan collection is known to be worth 
thousands!"
